@startuml InfraTrack-State
[*] --> REPORTED : citizen submits
REPORTED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : authority acknowledges
REPORTED --> REJECTED : invalid / duplicate
ACKNOWLEDGED --> IN_PROGRESS : work assigned / started
ACKNOWLEDGED --> REJECTED : invalid / duplicate
IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : repair complete
RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : reopened (problem recurs)
RESOLVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
note right of REPORTED : every transition\nrecords a StatusEvent
@enduml
